nfig directory in monorepo. Should change to `LanguageServiceHost.getProjectReferences` to reduce cpu and ram usages.","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"performance","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar|johnsoncodehk/volar\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1628430516}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m7md"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F9E5B189-76F2-4CED-B5B1-AD9300171516","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"typescript-language serverとかは最初からプロジェクトの見に行ってるんですよね","ts":"1630504184.259200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+pbP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CE1B3E8B-DB75-4B03-BDC4-1DBBF668EF3D","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"すいません。これを考え出すと...なんか無駄な話をしてしまいました。","ts":"1630504170.259100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CCyUp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b72630d-7c33-4769-ae7b-21ccd823933c","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"fmfm…その文脈を汲むなら、親切に(?)プロジェクトごとのTypeScriptを探しに行くのはやめて、`:LspSettingsLocalEdit` してもらうか、@volar/serverと一緒に入れたTypeScriptにフォールバックするか、の二択にする、みたいに割り切った方が安全な気もしました。","ts":"1630504000.256200","thread_ts":"1630504000.256200","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X74"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fe1853a-33aa-44c5-bee3-1b3ce2a11fd5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"VSCodeは最近、セキュリティ的な関係もあって。最初からプロジェクト内の typescript の検出すればーとも思うのですが、それが本当に正規の typescript なのか、悪意のあるものじゃないのかとかあるので。ユーザーの意思でプロジェクト内のみますよーみたいな設定を噛ませるような方向性のようなんですよね。","ts":"1630503827.254300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U7FL0Q71D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HDWR5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e95b51f3-5226-4022-93f8-a44ef02b53ab","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"今のvim-lspだと、`initializationOptions`は`string`で渡すしかないので、プロジェクトごとのTypeScriptライブラリを設定するには、vim-lsp-settingsと組み合わせて`:LspSettingsLocalEdit` で何とかするしかないと思っているのですが、それはあってますよね？\nなんで、`initializationOptions` にFuncrefも渡せるようにして、\n\u0026gt; デフォルトでnode_modulesの所のを見るのを記述\nをできるといいかな？と思った次第ですー。それ以外のデフォルトのために、一緒に@volar/serverと一緒にTypeScriptも入れちゃうのはアリですね。","ts":"1630503672.252200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LZn3T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"589a631b-3c87-4239-80f8-5ee6078e8da5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なので @volar/server と一緒に typescript もインストールしちゃってとりあえず、それを設定するって方法もできるかもです。ただ、やはり結局プロジェクトと差異があるとエラーの差異も出ちゃう場面も多くなるので。プロジェクトの設定したいですよｈね","ts":"1630503615.251200","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1630503640.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U7FL0Q71D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RsZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1280040c-4d67-4659-af2d-19591dac45e4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"vim-lsp-settingsでデフォルトでnode_modulesの所のを見るのを記述して、localでオーバーライドするのがよさそうだな...","ts":"1630503605.251000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U7FL0Q71D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tGn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae586d88-ae71-41ec-9137-58bea5fb7714","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"VSCode の volar は VSCode 組み込みの typescript を見るのがデフォで、オプションでプロジェクトの typescript を見るって感じな仕組みだったと思います。","ts":"1630503549.248900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vLM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E81983DB-DC76-4200-B633-140A00DD9932","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"monorepo とか考慮は大変なので一旦置いとくでいいと思います","ts":"1630503190.246900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lCS7f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c64ca7b-496c-4113-bf2e-a0cf86515d72","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"initializeOptionsだし、厳しい場合もありそう?","ts":"1630503186.246800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SOoaD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81DD1D6D-202D-4CE3-A423-30E05903716F","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"バッファを開いてるファイルから遡ってpackage.json もしくはnode_modulesを特定して探すではダメでしょうか？","ts":"1630503143.245400","edited":{"user":"U78A6ESHM","ts":"1630503157.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ftw9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c6c4539-7ee9-494f-9a8c-237e0b7acfb1","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"rootUriをpackage.jsonから決めようとしているので、そのとなりのnode_modulesの中のTypeScriptを見ればある程度汎用的かな、、と思っている感じですー。\nとは言え、まずはlocalな設定で、各自がプロジェクトごとに設定してもらう前提で良いかも知れませんね。","ts":"1630502737.243400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VbV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17f4986b-c68d-4589-9a22-b59ac7787125","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いちおう vim-lsp-settingsを使うなら、localな設定値持てるので、そこに書くことで対応はできるかな....","ts":"1630502074.241200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4a4E5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3633e163-404b-4c26-a481-d4dd33225bd8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ライブラリパスってrootUriから簡単に決めれる?(いやまあ難しいんだろうけど)","ts":"1630501993.240500","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1630502050.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jF0S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b248d0a-7fd3-4db8-a5e0-957d39a5a7ac","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"volar、`initializationOptions`でTypeScriptライブラリへのパスを渡さないといけないので、vim-lsp側で`root_uri`みたいにコールバックでも`initializationOptions` を渡せるようにしてもらわないといけないかも？？\n\u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar/blob/b03882f5c9c7e6827607206b8dc5566e02bfe189/packages/client/src/extension.ts#L164-L165\u003e","ts":"1630501928.240000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar/blob/b03882f5c9c7e6827607206b8dc5566e02bfe189/packages/client/src/extension.ts | extension.ts\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar/blob/b03882f5c9c7e6827607206b8dc5566e02bfe189/packages/client/src/extension.ts | extension.ts\u003e","text":"```\n\tconst initializationOptions: shared.ServerInitializationOptions = {\n\t\ttypescript: tsVersion.getCurrentTsPaths(context),\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar|johnsoncodehk/volar\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pu9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17c2331a-50cd-4302-a705-6c0b07c0f827","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"yaegassyさんに大感謝…！(gist更新しました)","ts":"1630497025.238000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":1,"users":["U7TMPGWJ0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/VF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7922c1e8-afc9-4104-b56d-293403c3f9f5","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"動かせましたーーー！\n`root_uri`に渡す`path`を`path_to_uri`してなかったのが一番の原因な気がしてきました…orz","ts":"1630496868.237600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P+I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c62311ed-6e41-4247-be46-f148944e8ed4","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"serverPath は tsserverlibrary.js でも typescript.js でもどっちを使ってもOKです","ts":"1630492865.236100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CEZd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f2efa70-b90b-4fc3-a895-a4712eedf497","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"enabledInTsScript とかも v:trueに (直近で変わりました)","ts":"1630492728.235900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N6A+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52bd1ca3-9964-4e4d-82c7-5f2013d5e5f7","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ごめんなさい...。VSCode以外から使う場合の設定についてドキュメント化されてないですしね。。たしかに現状だと設定で落とし穴ですね...","ts":"1630492526.235300","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1630493884.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zlP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5980e273-c7ba-4d41-b3e2-ffad48ca8920","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ついでに nvim lsp のも念の為。 \u003chttps://gist.github.com/yaegassy/4b7baf3efacb1cf2c1557a6d68a73f6c\u003e","ts":"1630492339.234500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6wTe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d02a974f-af2d-4542-a626-f1452e42a96f","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"なるほど、ありがとうございますー！","ts":"1630492084.234200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CFE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3952a485-92bb-459f-a996-491a45ec813c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"\"なんちゃらRequest\" 類の initialization_options を変更してみてください。これらは有効にしちゃうと TS のコードの処理類を必要としてしまうかもしれません。","ts":"1630492023.233700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6KHf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a351fe7b-b04f-4052-af97-af4f2a56e5a1","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ちなみに TS 4.4 だと、まだ不具合があります。テンプレートの一部で補完ができないとか。","ts":"1630491930.232600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W0y0="}]},{"client_msg_id":"796e4c79-1e84-4093-89cc-79825865372e","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"うーん、、どうでしょう。一応、gist に貼っておきます \u003chttps://gist.github.com/yaegassy/0c19a910e6b763b66ecdff7606925958\u003e","ts":"1630491899.231900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ahd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aaf6f6f0-ed81-41bc-a35d-c2777e0243b2","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"\u003c@U7TMPGWJ0\u003eあ、ごめんなさい。yaegassyさんの手元の設定と私の設定 \u003chttps://gist.github.com/tsukkee/578dee8508baa1667aa87227f7c2c434\u003e で違うところあったりしますか？\n```npm i @volar/server@0.27.12-alpha.1```\nしてきたあと、vue createしたてのVue 3のプロジェクトで試しているのですが、うまく動かせず…\n具体的には、まずはhoverやdefinitionを試しているのですが、No hover informationやNo definition foundになってしまってます。","ts":"1630491542.231600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5=wCr"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02DR773E4Q","text":"\u003c@U02DR773E4Q\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1630490448.229300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"038190ec-299f-4844-9ea4-32aeed994583","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あとは vim-lsp-settings ユーザーの皆さんにバトンタッチ。vim-lsp-settings にバージョン固定して入れれば大丈夫かもですが、まだ、バージョンアップが激しい時期な感じなので更新しないといつまでも古いやつを使ったりバグってるバージョンだったりみたいになってしまうかもですが","ts":"1630490400.229100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U7FL0Q71D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L0NRv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"907d998a-cbdb-42d0-ac93-7daec4621116","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vimmerに見つかったおかげでどんどん進化しててすごい","ts":"1630489704.228300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vSBB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33b9bf05-98e2-4665-860d-92a5e1da75ee","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"vim-lspとしては、このlspに限らずで\n最初はworkspaceFoldersのrootUirだけ入れて両方投げる対応\n後々は複数のtcdのrootを入れれるマルチ対応(できたらいいな)ですかねえ","ts":"1630489695.228200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YmM/r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6136d80b-6935-4e76-9fa0-abd190946c6e","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"master 落として yarn  \u0026amp;\u0026amp; yarn compile でもダイジョブです。次の正式リリースでは動きますね \u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar/commit/6a87f79510971b175abecf5a9e09642b7a12e077\u003e","ts":"1630489518.226900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qX9OD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d75aeb4b-f5ce-40ee-81b8-32e52d0a4f77","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"それの node_modules/@volar/server/out/index.js を使ってみてもらえると動くと思います。","ts":"1630489022.226200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tO3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97dafb38-8007-44bf-96f2-a91b28c4667c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"(workspaceFoldersに対応してないクライアントのリクエストはrootPathを使うみたいな修正)","ts":"1630488869.226000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3aD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6be9762-f166-4e63-b79c-061e6396ccf1","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"vim-lsp の修正パッチなしで動くとおもいます(僕の手元の環境では動きました)。","ts":"1630488771.225400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fwhM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40c02f10-2515-4f62-bb8b-ddcd91e6ca5c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"vim-lsp でも動くように alphaバージョンできました。\n```npm i @volar/server@0.27.12-alpha.1```","ts":"1630488709.224700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sokudo","count":2,"users":["U7FL0Q71D","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ime"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb73941e-4216-4c26-b651-3932102834bd","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"あ、たまたまですが \u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/vscode-languageserver-node/blob/cfcd91703fb514658fd63b43deb2405bad9ba9c5/protocol/src/common/protocol.ts#L966-L973\u003e を見つけたのでw\n```    /**\n     * The rootUri of the workspace. Is null if no\n     * folder is open. If both `rootPath` and `rootUri` are set\n     * `rootUri` wins.\n     *\n     * @deprecated in favour of workspaceFolders.\n     */\n    rootUri: DocumentUri | null;```\n","ts":"1630488114.224000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y8O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09fed5c1-41d3-420a-bbb4-163cc1565d55","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれかな、マルチworkspace対応を見越した感じなのかな","ts":"1630487989.223500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rHbr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4daa1e26-020b-49a2-acaa-77bb6e717b9f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"そうなんですか！(僕、よくわかってないw)","ts":"1630487700.223100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Xs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d43ca47-83be-41d6-976b-9127992323b2","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"LSP的には`rootUri`がdeprecatedで`workspaceFolders`にかわる感じなんすね。","ts":"1630486882.222800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"epw2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1296fd65-2492-4eba-b4cf-fbf175112cf4","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"話が早いw ありがとうございますー","ts":"1630486633.222100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AgH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81275b4c-894f-4caf-b5a3-467651c6b6c1","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"近々、対応してくれるようです！！ 直近の新バージョンでってことはないかもしれないですが。","ts":"1630486597.221800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+2No"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d395dda-ebd4-46c8-b8ff-e4be2f7cb01c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"volar の作者さんに volar 側で調整可能か、伝えてみますね。勿論 vim-lsp 側で workspaceFolders に対応して頂けたほうが良いなとは思うのですが。","ts":"1630486239.220300","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1630486259.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i4/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"357ddc78-635d-4ecb-b028-f447a874d214","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"おーーーまじっすか！すごい。私も試してみますー","ts":"1630485088.219000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n4z6+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4d3d761-8986-4c7a-bb70-30ef8bfb8132","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"どうやら *workspaceFolders* に対応していないと動かない状況でした。 vim-lsp で正しい追加方法はわかりませんが、どうせ対応してないならってことで周辺の root_uri の情報類のを参考にそのまま入れてみてといった感じで動きました。\n```diff --git a/autoload/lsp.vim b/autoload/lsp.vim\nindex f54da99..8052c02 100644\n--- a/autoload/lsp.vim\n+++ b/autoload/lsp.vim\n@@ -603,6 +603,7 @@ function! s:ensure_init(buf, server_name, cb) abort\n     \\     'capabilities': l:capabilities,\n     \\     'rootUri': l:root_uri,\n     \\     'rootPath': lsp#utils#uri_to_path(l:root_uri),\n+    \\     'workspaceFolders': [{'uri': l:root_uri, 'name': lsp#utils#uri_to_path(l:root_uri)}],\n     \\     'trace': 'off',\n     \\   },\n     \\ }```","ts":"1630484493.217900","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1630484685.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":3,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U7FL0Q71D","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TsG+5"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1630484365.216200","files":[{"id":"F02CLFMHSDD","created":1630484358,"timestamp":1630484358,"name":"vokar-vim-lsp.mp4","title":"volar-vim-lsp.mp4","mimetype":"video/mp4","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"mp4","pretty_type":"MPEG 4ビデオ","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":930407,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02CLFMHSDD/vokar-vim-lsp.mp4","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02CLFMHSDD/download/vokar-vim-lsp.mp4","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","thumb_80":"","thumb_160":"","thumb_360":"","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":0,"thumb_360_h":0,"thumb_480":"","thumb_480_w":0,"thumb_480_h":0,"thumb_720":"","thumb_720_w":0,"thumb_720_h":0,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/U7TMPGWJ0/F02CLFMHSDD/vokar-vim-lsp.mp4","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F02CLFMHSDD-455878748e","edit_link":"","preview":"","preview_highlight":"","lines":0,"lines_more":0,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"thumb_video":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02CLFMHSDD-663b58407a/vokar-vim-lsp_thumb_video.jpeg","display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"username":""}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"eddac5b9-ac29-4c6b-b638-7a55cbade073","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"再度 vim-lsp で volar のチャレンジをしてみました。 Language Server 側にデバッグコード仕込んだりして進めて。vim-lsp をいじって volar を動かすことができました。","ts":"1630484139.216100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"god","count":2,"users":["U7FL0Q71D","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c1F4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa47e3ed-36e5-4e57-a5e7-9e59d020813c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"どういうケースで使うべきなのかよくわかってません。既存のLSでもたしかあるんですよねー。例えば YAML の LS で vim-lsp で dynamic registration に対応してないから フォーマットの機能が動かない？とか (記憶違いかもですが)","ts":"1630462114.214300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U7FL0Q71D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0qE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d666933-612b-4791-bb53-ac6d56927c4a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"僕もよくわかってません。てんなしさんのこれとか \u003chttps://github.com/tennashi/lsp_spec_ja#register-capability\u003e","ts":"1630461992.213000","thread_ts":"1630461992.213000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"tennashi/lsp_spec_ja","id":1,"title":"tennashi/lsp_spec_ja","text":"LSP 仕様の日本語訳","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"112","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"7 days ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"pray","count":1,"users":["U7FL0Q71D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bMG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0c5727d-072c-402e-9508-59876d627b2b","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"dynamic registrationが何かとかあまり良く分かっていないので、もう少しLSPの仕様と各実装を把握しないといけない気がしてきました…","ts":"1630461290.212400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VQ1l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97c4127e-f61f-4b52-9374-5b96b1ddf534","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"むしろ Vim9 では `#{}` は使えません。`#` がコメントになるからです。ただし `{}` だけで `#{}` と同様に(JavaScript のリテラルみたいに)書けます。","ts":"1630460616.211400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7TMPGWJ0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s/50M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c241f807-adbb-4d18-a32b-c2f9f7941a9c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Sublime の lsp も volar が動かないのは  dynamic registration が原因で。 Sublime の lsp 自体は  dynamic registration にも対応してるようでそれを使うように変更したら使えるようになったといった経緯です。","ts":"1630459879.210300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xXO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed973761-23d2-49ee-992a-167fa3418d03","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"たしかに、通信は繋がっているけどCapabilitiesがうまく認識されていない風なので、どこかで辻褄合ってなさそうですね。","ts":"1630459739.209200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4nN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fb1d6f7-b635-4ee0-831e-1571e14b6717","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"そういう感じの話で動かないのかなーと思っています。","ts":"1630459638.207900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7FL0Q71D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yjT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"749f8b61-c114-400d-b147-0030d4cfc0c3","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"vim-lsp で動かないのは更にまた、なにか原因がありそうです。例えば先日、 typescript-language-server の最新バージョンで vim-lsp から診断(リント)が動かないってことがあったのですが、 vim-lsp が publishDiagnostics を Language Server に送っていないので診断(リント)は対応してないクライアントですーって認識されてしまってたってことがありました。","ts":"1630459600.207500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zuZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42c33b30-f44b-44eb-8a1a-27b5ab323ab4","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Neovim の lsp で volar が動かなかったのは Neovim が dynamic registration に対応してないからが原因のようで。 volar 本体側で dynamic registration を使わないよう変更してみて実用的に動くようになりました。","ts":"1630459447.205300","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1630459674.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9LO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd92af18-a87f-466e-80ff-0fa65733a0e0","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ついでに MacVim もビルドして最新です","ts":"1630459113.204900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"banjaku","count":3,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U7FL0Q71D","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FWjr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41ed9f3a-cbe5-4c56-8807-6c0481092dad","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"いえいえ。僕はVimもNeovimもいつも最新で、いつでもどっちもバッチリ使えます。 `#{}` は Vim8 でも使えたのですねー。なるほど","ts":"1630459050.204300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ba","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"njaku","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mmi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96bb43b6-0ac8-4f93-9d5a-954a9308cbf1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"stableに入るのはめっちゃかかりそう・・・","ts":"1630458951.203500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hjJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4e13f76-b1d5-420c-851f-eb490eb73550","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"method入ったしこれもパッチ送れば入るのかな","ts":"1630458838.203100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SOQw7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc4572b4-6f8f-4ffb-85bd-eab5156bfe38","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"なるほど、Neovim/Vim両対応しようとするとこの記法は使えないんすね…","ts":"1630458828.202700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9ia"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c53f4ca-7e77-44f1-acbb-c93afd3df7a4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"上に書いてあった","ts":"1630458812.202000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WuVD="}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a17a5cc-6a93-4d85-b7d9-b53e8e09b686","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Neovimで動かなくてゴリラさんのプラグインの記法を置換してた記憶がある","ts":"1630458799.201700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LOrdZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eff1c0c1-791c-437a-be5e-9cb41b8df10c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"yaegassyさんNeovimでしたよね確か","ts":"1630458788.201400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"svQ7W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e591056-621a-41f1-8ae8-7afd7dc2b872","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それ、Neovimにはないんですよね、つらい","ts":"1630458772.200600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U7FL0Q71D","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6o5ZT"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *literal-Dict* *#{}*\nすべてのキーを引用符で囲む必要を避けるために、#{} 形式を使用できる。この形式\nは、ASCII文字、数字、'-' および '_' のみで構成されるキーを必要とする。\n例:  \n        :let mydict = #{zero: 0, one_key: 1, two-key: 2, 333: 3}\nNote ここでは 333 は 文字列 \"333\" であることに注意。空のキーは #{} を使うこと\nができない。\n \n値はどんな式でもよい。辞書を値にすると、ネストした辞書ができる:  \n        :let nestdict = {1: {11: 'a', 12: 'b'}, 2: {21: 'c'}}\n \n最後の要素の後に余分なコンマがあると無視される。\n \n \n要素にアクセスする  \n \n通常、要素にアクセスするには[]の中にキーを書く:  \n        :let val = mydict[\"one\"]\n        :let mydict[\"four\"] = 4\n \nまた、この書き方で既存の辞書に要素を追加できる。この点はリストと異なる。\n \nキー名がアルファベット、数字、アンダースコアだけからなる場合は、以下の形式が使\nえる|expr-entry|:  \n        :let val = mydict.one\n        :let mydict.four = 4\n \n要素はリストや辞書を含むどんな型でもよいため、インデックス参照とキー参照を続け\nて書くことができる:  \n        :echo dict.key[idx].key\n \n \n辞書からリストへの変換  \n \n辞書の全要素に対してループを行いたい場合がある。そのためには辞書をリストに変換\nし、そのリストに対して|:for|ループを行う。\n \n多くの場合はキーに対してループを行う。これには関数|keys()|を使う:  \n        :for key in keys(mydict)\n        :   echo key . ': ' . mydict[key]\n        :endfor\n \nこのキーのリストはソートされていない。ソートさせるには関数|sort()|を使う:  \n        :for key in sort(keys(mydict))\n \n値に対してループを行うには関数|values()|を使う:  \n        :for v in values(mydict)\n        :   echo \"value: \" . v\n        :endfor\n \nキーと値両方を得るには関数|items()|を使う。この関数は、キーと値の2個の要素から\nなるリストのリストを返す:  \n        :for [key, value] in items(mydict)\n        :   echo key . ': ' . value\n        :endfor\n \n \n辞書の同一性\n```","ts":"1630458747.200100","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"cc46a22d-c645-4d37-8c81-4d791f56365a","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"Dictionaryを`#{}`で宣言するのは普通にできますよー\n:h literal-Dict","ts":"1630458746.200000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BlZVg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06c0fc19-4f65-4d76-9147-ed587ea3515e","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"むっ、Vim9 Script記法？","ts":"1630458496.198600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2yI7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7f63e5f-f315-4fd6-83ab-99c1355dcf26","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"自分も↓のような感じにすると動くかなーと試しつつ、まだ成功してないです…\n補完スニペットについては、vim-lspの場合だと、例えばvim-vsnipとvim-vsnip-integと併用すれば大丈夫そうです。\n\u003chttps://gist.github.com/tsukkee/578dee8508baa1667aa87227f7c2c434\u003e","ts":"1630457428.197700","thread_ts":"1630449628.196800","edited":{"user":"U7FL0Q71D","ts":"1630458893.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"40uo"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"16a5e219-68ee-438a-9344-896eb39b241f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"残念ながら vim-lsp は同じような感じで設定してもまだ動かせませんでした。。何かvim-lsp自体で足りないものがあるのかもしれないのですが理由がわからない。。","ts":"1630449628.196800","thread_ts":"1630449628.196800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LGBG"}]}},{"type":"message","user":"U01G63H9VN3","text":"\u003c@U01G63H9VN3\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1630451329.197200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"9a173bf3-4095-40d1-b6b7-b6c2ef76b013","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あとは volar 自体が悪いと思うのですが補完にLSPのスニペットがついてる場合、coc以外ではエラーが出ちゃうケースがあるかも...","ts":"1630451060.197000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IxO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16a5e219